Description: GTK4 GUI and CLI for managing FreeIPA servers
 FreeIPA Manager provides a GTK4/Adwaita GUI and CLI for managing
 FreeIPA servers with sidebar navigation, settings view, user/group/host
 management, and keyboard shortcuts.
